{"retcode":0,"message":"OK","data":{"page":{"id":"506241","name":"终北遗嗣的祷献","desc":"挪德卡莱武器突破素材 终北遗嗣的祷献","icon_url":"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/09/09/183046623/e0d937bedd15ba5193b987b2e4b62d50_2280346673844076617.png","header_img_url":"","modules":[{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"material_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"name\":\"终北遗嗣的祷献\",\"img\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/09/09/183046623/e0d937bedd15ba5193b987b2e4b62d50_4768143387916797594.png\",\"star\":4,\"materials\":{\"key\":\"获得方式\",\"value\":\"\u003cp\u003e【\u003ca href=\\\"https://baike.mihoyo.com/ys/obc/content/506308/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e失落的月庭\u003c/a\u003e（周三/六/日）】炼武秘境：祭月Ⅲ/Ⅳ\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e合成获得\u003c/p\u003e\"},\"attr\":[{\"key\":\"描述\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e赋予武器突破之力的材料。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e银白如清辉的锋刃是恩主的慈恻。以仁慈之名，众生皆得以向明日献上希望。即便是未能「完成」的残次品，肤下流淌的亦是月光无垢的祝福。即便是微不足道的祝福，铢积寸累，亦能让浸入其中的圣嗣更接近终将到来的「乐园」。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e一切罪愆与凶慝最终都会被无瑕的月光洗净，因此一切泪水与苦厄皆为必要的牺牲——至少崇月的人们曾如此坚信不疑。\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"用途\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e武器突破素材\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e　　　【炼金】\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"506240\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/09/09/183046623/aefdbe0f99c265319c762e270a898c5a_3149709957411903415.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"终北遗嗣的煌熠\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/506240/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/506240/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e终北遗嗣的煌熠\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"1346","is_customize_name":true,